Author: devbymanan <devbymanan@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Jul 22 13:20:00 2026 +0500

    Add device_sync.py for attendance synchronization with ZKTeco TM F650
    
    This script connects to a ZKTeco TM F650 terminal using the SBXPC SDK to pull attendance punches and write them into the AttendanceMS database. It includes configuration for device connection parameters and handles mapping of device user IDs to employee records in the database. Unmapped punches are reported for verification.

